# Components

See `rule/components.md`.

- Default export for `GeoPicker`, `ContactForm`, `AppShell`, `StatCard`.
- Reuse `inputClass`, `labelClass`, `btnPrimary`, `btnGhost` from `ui.js`.
- Pass `nodes` and callbacks into `GeoPicker` / `ContactForm`. Do not subscribe them to the store without need.
- GeoPicker: blank `<option value="">` always. Parent change clears children. Rural/Urban disabled until `assembly` is set.
- New records: default geoPath `{ lok_sabha: "ls-1", assembly: "ac-1" }`. Filters may use `allowEmpty`.
- Appointment files: `fileToDocument`, max 400 KB, data URL in state.
